+## Standalone view rendering transport
+
+| Contract | Implementation | Tests | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Rendered declarations retain the same conversion element IDs on native, JavaScript/WASM and WASI targets; synthetic notation has no invented model identity. | `internal/frontend/renderidentity.Bind`, combined `RenderView` dispatch | `TestIdentityCoverage`, `TestRenderIdentityAndNotationFields`, `TestRenderingAndExportShareConversionIdentities` | Implemented; source-origin binding reuses the conversion identity backend. |
